<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-στρέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn asiae, alter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				418a
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to</i>
			
			<i>be displaced to one side</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἢ ἔνθα ἢ ἔνθα ἡ ῥίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στόμα παρεστραμμένος</span>”
				<i>Com.A desp.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					386
				</span></i>
			 ; of trees, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ εὐφυές, ἀλλὰ παρεστραμμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					4.2.6
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέστραπται δὲ καὶ ὄσσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					758
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>turn aside</i>, esp. for the worse, <i>peruert</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν μοῖραν ἐς τὸ μὴ χρεών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					491.3
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχαὶ παρεστραμμέναι τῆς κατὰ φύσιν
					ἕξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1342a22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν τρίβωνα</span>, as a sign of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνελευθερία</span>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				22.13
			</span></i>.</div>
